# Networking

Six shared external Docker networks, created once by the `networks`
bootstrap stack (`stacks/compose.networks.yaml`). Traefik reaches services
through `proxy`; everything else communicates on its own fabric, so nothing
is needlessly exposed.

| Network        | Purpose                                              |
| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `proxy`        | Traefik reaches every service that has a hostname    |
| `dns`          | pihole -> unbound upstream; rspamd -> unbound resolver |
| `pihole`       | pihole-influxdb-monitor -> pihole API                 |
| `mail_filter`  | rspamd <-> rspamd-redis <-> rspamd-iscan             |
| `mail_archive` | dovecot <-> imapsync (fully isolated mail archive)    |
| `metrics`      | influxdb <-> grafana <-> telegraf <-> exporters       |

